The hand fitting implementation originated in Sanjo Solutions' game authoring
tools. This distribution contains the addon source and generated test fixtures.
Character models, textures, animations, and other game assets belong to their
respective distributions.

The public hand previews are rendered from an adult female MPFB core model.
MPFB / MakeHuman core assets are CC0-1.0:
https://static.makehumancommunity.org/mpfb/faq/why_use.html
The MPFB model and generator are not included in the extension ZIP.
The preview skin uses MakeHuman's young_caucasian_female material and
young_lightskinned_female_diffuse.png with MPFB's MakeSkin shader and nail mask.
